{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An\u00a0<strong>incremental adventure packed with tons of content and progression.</strong>\u00a0Every battle, you will unlock a new way to defeat hordes of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005560/extras/99d84905a822cef473b59fb245f87629.poster.avif?t=1774538513\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005560/extras/99d84905a822cef473b59fb245f87629.webm?t=1774538513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005560/extras/99d84905a822cef473b59fb245f87629.mp4?t=1774538513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Skill Tree</strong>: Every node matters, unlock meaningful stats, not just a boring +1 damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot &amp; Items</strong>: Defeat enemies to earn rare items that dramatically boost your power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shiny Monsters</strong>: Encounter rare Shiny variants that  grant special effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills</strong>: Acquire and upgrade a variety of skills to eliminate your foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Archer</strong>: Unlock the loyal Archer, who leaps into battle to automatically slay monsters at your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mining</strong>: Gather ores and refine gems to customize and enhance your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First System","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005560/fa01d8184e1b91b70c62cef12cfb15788f20b121.jpg"},{"name":"Tree Finisher","p